# Regex patterns, one per line, matched against repository-relative paths.
# .kore/ holds local key material; no scanner may ever read it.
^\.kore/
(^|/)node_modules/
(^|/)dist/
(^|/)bin/
(^|/)coverage/
# SOPS-encrypted files are expected ciphertext (ENC[...] values), not leaked secrets.
\.enc\.yaml$
# Vendored upstream Keycloak CRD: the JDBC detector reports a documentation example sentence in an upstream description (no host, no credential). The current file is trimmed and scans clean; the line stays only while the branch history holds the original, and can go once the change is squashed.
(^|/)infra/charts/keycloak-operator/templates/crd-keycloaks\.yaml$
